\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {24}{\ignorespaces Exploratory ANOVA on DGEKT downstream AUC under graph perturbation (ASSISTments and XES3G5M; three folds per operator/strength; Table~S20). Dependent variable: test AUC after retraining on the perturbed graph. Partial $\eta ^2$ as above. This analysis supports the null predictive-sensitivity finding in Section~\ref {sec:exp-ddr-downstream}; it does not establish backbone dominance.}}{13}{table.caption.54}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:anova-ddr-downstream}{{24}{13}{Exploratory ANOVA on DGEKT downstream AUC under graph perturbation (ASSISTments and XES3G5M; three folds per operator/strength; Table~S20). Dependent variable: test AUC after retraining on the perturbed graph. Partial $\eta ^2$ as above. This analysis supports the null predictive-sensitivity finding in Section~\ref {sec:exp-ddr-downstream}; it does not establish backbone dominance}{table.caption.54}{}}
